t": "2015-01-26T20:39:54Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7bf09c7e0acf11f4c760fe4cc9ae5cbb86d80d98", "message": "Search Error\n\nSearch error found when more than one text parameter is used.", "created_at": "2015-01-22T17:55:27Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d128d64cc693b250235b4fb8085b78e65310d5c9", "message": "Graphing & Preview Window\n\nAdded basic graphic and created DGV control to preview input file in\ncase user isn't sure what sort of data is in each column. Changed write\nperiodically to a Task for better thread handling and in order to have\nit wait to generate the graph till searching is over.", "created_at": "2015-01-21T00:06:01Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ecfa82540a23baf7997398797c31bd1a74f73f2a", "message": "Initial Deployment\n\nVersion sent out for testing. All known bugs fixed. Charting and .csv\nsupport still to be added. Icon, splash screen, and help form updated.", "created_at": "2015-01-16T21:16:11Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea3d45926573dbe71771269382f1e3c68a870622", "message": "Iteration #5\n\nMultithreading introduced and subsequently broken. Search until 25,000\nresults are found, then write them all, clear the results storage, and\ncontinue searching. Bug with search threads not reporting their state\nproperly.", "created_at": "2015-01-14T20:52:33Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9da3209690a814f04193621de84a025d41fdc8ee", "message": "Load Change\n\nCounts bytes of file rather than linecount for much faster loading. Can\nstill use it for progress bar, etc.", "created_at": "2015-01-09T21:38:40Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3f536b669f7603cc2f363497bc8ef44d66a64c64", "message": "Numeric Search Fixes, Help Form Updated\n\nChanged the numericUpDowns to accept numbers >100, negative numbers, and\ndecimals. Updated the help form to display more relevant information.\nStill need to update trouble shooting.", "created_at": "2015-01-08T19:47:21Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2b75086491651efb7d0d67bd6f9cba72af090e57", "message": "Layout Changes, Reset Rework\n\nChanged dynamic population so scrolling will be vertical rather than\nhorizontal. Fixed the reset button so it resets all the controls\nproperly. Fixed search hits textbox.", "created_at": "2015-01-07T22:05:38Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "34b57fe7f628ab26a787b05655cdbb281c7b1490", "message": "Initial Commit\n\nDynamically fills GUI based on number of columns.", "created_at": "2015-01-07T18:35:43Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b1d0c2a43299c4cd218120c9c19493943422fcb6", "message": "File Read, Column DataType Assignments\n\nFixed column datatype problem.", "created_at": "2015-01-04T21:08:08Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "81884c456127f468be432be47d32458adff40260", "message": "Documentation Added\n\nAdded documentation. Deleted old functions and controls.", "created_at": "2015-01-01T22:38:37Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ee4368c36cb30bfc36f56d898ef02bbf40f39360", "message": "Bug Fixes\n\nFixed bug where every other line was skipped when searching/exporting.\nFixed progress bar and label - may move to statusbar if it can be fixed.\nSearch time: ~20 minutes for one field. Need to improve.", "created_at": "2015-01-01T20:33:53Z", "repo": "ChroSearch", "file_sampled": fals